  "content": "<p>JourneyPAC 是一款适用于 Minecraft 的客户端模组，同时也是 JourneyMap 的插件，用于显示通过 OpenPAC 声明的区块。<br>\n灵感来源于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap Integration</a>，该插件为 FTB 声明系统提供了类似功能。</p><h2>依赖项</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/open-parties-and-claims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Open Parties and Claims</a></li>\n<li>(1.1.7 版本之前，Fabric) <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config API Port</a></li>\n</ul>",
